"SORA will move its records of transactions that were still being confirmed to a separate folder on this iPhone. Nothing is deleted, and your accounts, keys and funds are not changed. SORA will no longer be able to tell you whether your most recent transaction went through, so check your activity before you send it again." = "SORA 會將仍在確認中的交易記錄移到此 iPhone 上的單獨資料夾。不會刪除任何內容，您的帳戶、金鑰和資金不會改變。SORA 將無法再判斷您最近的交易是否成功，請先查看交易活動，再決定是否重新傳送。";
"Set aside" = "單獨存放";
"Could not set the records aside" = "無法單獨存放記錄";
