"The earlier data could not be returned safely. Its files and keys have been kept. Reopen SORA to resume an interrupted return, or restore with your original backup." = "無法安全返回先前的資料。檔案和金鑰已保留。請重新打開 SORA 以繼續中斷的返回操作，或使用原始備份復原。";
"The earlier files were kept. Reopen SORA to continue, or try again." = "先前的檔案已保留。請重新打開 SORA 以繼續，或再試一次。";
"The export can contain public wallet metadata, including addresses, account names, preferences, and transaction history." = "導出檔案可能包含公開的錢包中繼資料，包括地址、帳戶名稱、偏好設定和交易歷史。";
"The installed wallet, settings, recovery marker, and Keychain were not changed." = "已安裝的錢包、設定、復原標記和鑰匙圈未被更改。";
